ue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And forget that there were ever any Abilities named &quot;Martial Arts&quot;. Especially if they were Skills that requires a higher point cost than normal for Abilities.<br /> <br /> (I'm not fond of that system, obviously.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Without getting into a discussion about whether that was a good system (never used/didn't wanna use it/used WoD Combat, which was its own quagmire), one would hope that they would <i>fix</i> whatever needs to be fixed. That said, it was a little presumptuous for those, ahem, <i>minor</i> lines, to try to have their own combat system, huh?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sig","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2319-captotter","name":"CaptOtter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2319_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"405"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T21:24:08-08:00","id":87209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CaptOtter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/86593-kueijin-laibon-mummy-hsien-shih-sorcerer-hunter-fallen-ect?p=87156#post87156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Without getting into a discussion about whether that was a good system (never used/didn't wanna use it/used WoD Combat, which was its own quagmire), one would hope that they would <i>fix</i> whatever needs to be fixed. That said, it was a little presumptuous for those, ahem, <i>minor</i> lines, to try to have their own combat system, huh?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was simply a bad idea that managed to get too much traction. Of course, it's also the little things that drive you crazy... and present an exotified view of many cultures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-08T23:50:22-08:00","id":87293,"title":"","content":"What the Hell is a Laibon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T01:07:00-08:00","id":87336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PaladinDemo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/86593-kueijin-laibon-mummy-hsien-shih-sorcerer-hunter-fallen-ect?p=87293#post87293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What the Hell is a Laibon?</div> </div> </div> </div> African Kindred.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/260-chase-variant","name":"Chase Variant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar260_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T11:22:58-07:00","id":87606,"title":"","content":"Raging against the Hsien is kind of one of my favorite scabs to pick at, so I'll try to keep this brief. If they get revised, I hope the writers don't reference Changeling at all and present them as the wholly unrelated splat. They have no connection to their &quot;parent&quot; line, and I think adding such a connection would be too radical of a shift. There are people who like what the Hsien are right now, and I wouldn't want to shit on that by demanding a complete rebuild. But every time I look at my OWoD shelf and see that C:tD logo lying to me from the cover of Lo8MD, my blood pressure spikes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-09T11:31:34-07:00","id":87611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hanged Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/86593-kueijin-laibon-mummy-hsien-shih-sorcerer-hunter-fallen-ect?p=87606#post87606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Raging against the Hsien is kind of one of my favorite scabs to pick at, so I'll try to keep this brief. If they get revised, I hope the writers don't reference Changeling at all and present them as the wholly unrelated splat. They have no connection to their &quot;parent&quot; line, and I think adding such a connection would be too radical of a shift. There are people who like what the Hsien are right now, and I wouldn't want to shit on that by demanding a complete rebuild. But every time I look at my OWoD shelf and see that C:tD logo lying to me from the cover of Lo8MD, my blood pressure spikes.</div> </div> </div> </div>See you could actually make the Connection with Dark Age Fae as the link between both of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T01:01:10-07:00","id":88015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chase Variant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/86593-kueijin-laibon-mummy-hsien-shih-sorcerer-hunter-fallen-ect?p=87336#post87336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> African Kindred.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah I see.<br /> <br /> I'm guessing the Hsien and Shih are Leeches as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T02:04:18-07:00","id":88031,"title":"","content":"The Hsirn are banished gods that served heaven, they are very similar in history to say Demon the Fallen, but with a lesser banishment rather then damnation. The Shih are elite super monks that serve as the judges and the peacekeepers to the supernatural. They have a potent numina and may act as monster hunters if necessary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T09:18:56-07:00","id":88225,"title":"","content":"I don't remember them in either Reckoning or Fallen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-10T09:39:29-07:00","id":88237,"title":"","content":"That is because Hsien are found in a book called Land of Eight Million Dreams for CtD and the Shih can be found in WoD: Demon Hunter X. Hsien are little Gods banished from 100 Clouds, but there is a way to return, and like said Shih are mortal Judges to the supernatural beings who fail to keep to their own mandates, both are pretty much only found in Asia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T00:42:17-07:00","id":89321,"title":"","content":"Both are also fun to read","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T01:34:28-07:00","id":89343,"title":"","content":"The Classic WoD was published -- and had new lines out regularly -- from 1991 to 2003. We're only up to 20th anniversary editions from 1994 so far. Give us time.<br /> <br /> It's not like our schedule isn't pretty full as-is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T03:16:19-07:00","id":89371,"title":"","content":"Oh, come on, Ian - you can do a Kickstarter each month, giving us 12 20th anniversary titles each year, can't you? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1506-lubricus","name":"Lubricus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-12T17:18:22-07:00","id":89836,"title":"","content":"Given how interconnected the Eastern setting is, it might be worth it to look at one giant book to deal with Hsien, Kuei-Jin, Hengeyokai, Shih (and Strike Force Zero of course), Dragons of the East, and all the other crazy stuff going on over there. The only one that could really NEED its own giant book is KOE. The others could fairly easily all be chapters in a big Book of the East that references their original western source material when needed, but presents the variants. <br /> <br /> Personally (since we're up to 1994), I'd like to see 20th Anniversary Gypsy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"<a href=http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png target=_blank>http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png</a>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"<a href=http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png target=_blank>http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png</a>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2323-killersquirrel59","name":"killersquirrel59","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"558"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-20T01:50:32-07:00","id":94798,"title":"","content":"Well KotE can probably do a companion book, with Hsien, Shih, and the others getting wedged into a companion volume. Hunter and Fallen will get their respective turns soon enough; I suspect the real litmus test will be Wraith20. Laibon may make an appearance as a Vampire supplement, after heavy review. Masquerade supplements seem to be popular. I like the idea of a big book of numinous humans, but Sorcerer will likely be a Mage supplement depending on how well that KS goes. Mummy will be tricky, as it was not a full game, was never especially popular, and has two very different views on how the characters were made. Maybe it could work as a V20 supplement, but I won't hold my breath.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","na